# EdgeX Life points at the SAME Supabase project as Pulse and xFocus
# (cloud: mdkyijbgvxedelcqcouu) so goals can link to Pulse tasks and habits
# under the same user id. Sign in with your PULSE account.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in the anon key. On Vercel, set these
# as project environment variables — .env.local is gitignored, and a missing
# key is the classic cause of a blank deployed screen.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://mdkyijbgvxedelcqcouu.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# Optional: deep-link target for the "Open Pulse" button
VITE_PULSE_URL=
